{"3196530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Super Waifu Ball", "steam_appid": 3196530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Waifu Ball<br><i>Roll, Collect, and Waifu Your Way to Victory!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a gravity-defying, action-packed adventure in Super Waifu Ball, an arcade-style game where you roll through vibrant, obstacle-filled worlds as you control a cast of lovable waifus. Master each level, collect stars, and navigate through increasingly tricky courses to unlock exciting rewards and surprises!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Unique Worlds: Explore 8 diverse worlds, each packed with challenging obstacles, tricky traps, and complex challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Playable Waifus: Choose from 5 different waifus, each with their own charm and personality. Whether you’re in it for the challenge or just the fun of playing as your favorite waifu, there’s something for everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Mode: Test your skills with the “Challenge Mode,” a tougher set of levels that will push your abilities to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles: Complete levels with perfect scores to earn stars that unlock collectible waifu figurines straight from the gacha machine. The more stars you collect, the more figurines you can unlock! Can you collect them all?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll your way through exciting levels, defeat obstacles, and collect stars as you work to unlock adorable waifu figurines. Whether you're playing for the thrill of the challenge or just to see what your next collectible will be, Super Waifu Ball is sure to keep you entertained for hours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll, collect, and dive into the waifu-filled adventure of your dreams!</p>", "about_the_g